<title>YEMEN: Yemen gets $13.4 mln U.N. aid for water projects.</title>
<headline>Yemen gets $13.4 mln U.N. aid for water projects.</headline>
<dateline>ADEN 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) said on Monday it gave Yemen $13.4 million in aid to finance water projects spanning a period of five years.</p>
<p>A UNDP statement said the aid had been granted in accordance with a deal signed between the United Nations organisation and Yemen's ministry of planning. The projects are due to be implemented by the year 2001, the statement said.</p>
<p>Water is a scare resource in Yemen, one of the poorest Arab countries.</p>
</text>
